[en.FOCUS_C01_RENDERING_THREATS]
Rendering Threats

[en.FOCUS_C01_RENDERING_THREATS_desc]
The enemies of the Empire is everywhere! Those who live in peace for too long shall not forget the constant threat! Remember: War is Harmony!

[zh.FOCUS_C01_RENDERING_THREATS]
渲染威胁

[zh.FOCUS_C01_RENDERING_THREATS_desc]
帝国的敌者无处不在！那些在和平中沉浸太久的小马们不该忘记持续存在的威胁！记住：战争即和谐！

